WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.820
So why have you gathered us all here today?

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.080
Well, since the school festival was such a success,

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.920
I thought it'd be nice if we just spent 
some time together enjoying ourselves.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.480
I see. I suppose a little rest 
every now and then won't hurt.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.500
Look, Yuri!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.930
The cosmos have finally bloomed!

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.540
Yes, they do look rather beautiful.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:30.710
Ah!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.800
This flower's really cute too!

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.230
Those are bur-marigolds.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.010
Shy little Tsubomi's finally managed to change herself.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.640
Itsuki's finally being honest about the things she likes.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.520
And the Flower of Yuri's Heart is blooming again!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.940
Your big sis is so happy for you all!

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.560
Erika, stop looking down on people!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.320
And you're not anyone's "big sis"!

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.910
Anyway, look!

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.160
No matter what kind of cheap tricks the Desert Apostles use,

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:02.540
if the four of us work together, then we'll always, <i>always</i> pull through!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.440
Right!

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.480
Yes!

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.220
You really think so?

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.250
Huh?

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.560
We've got trouble!

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.090
Grandma?

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.250
Grandma!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.790
I'm counting on you, girls!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.210
HeartCatch

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.670
Precure!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.260
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.220
Now, all together

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.730
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.360
Within each of our chests,

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.030
they begin to sprout

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.700
The seeds of the heart

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.950
are growing

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.580
bit by bit

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.240
Red,

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:25.860
white

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.180
and yellow

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.920
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.380
all varied colors

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.850
that they

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.000
shine so brightly!

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:40.340
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.850
with such care

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.560
will never wither

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:49.140
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.020
Now, all together

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.480
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.150
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:02.090
They're always right by our sides

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.900
So together

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.700
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.660
bloom even more!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.210
HeartCatch

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.710
Precure!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.970
We'll Become Stronger<i>!</i>

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.970
We'll Become Stronger<i>!</i>

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.720
A Desertrian?!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:42.750
No.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:46.740
A Desertrian is something born of the Flower of someone's Heart, weakened enough to be usable.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.980
Just what <i>is</i> that?

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.480
The flowers!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.900
Are you trying to turn this town into a desert?!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.770
There's no way I'll let you!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.410
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.080
Precure!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.750
Open My Heart!

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.310
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.360
Cure Blossom!

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.550
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.900
Cure Marine!

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:41.270
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.390
Cure Sunshine!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.010
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.430
Cure Moonlight!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.800
Please, stop doing this!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.530
Thank you so much, Marine!

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:18.000
How dare you do that to my best friend?!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.440
Marine!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:26.940
Marine!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.590
Are you all okay?

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.530
Yeah...

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.080
Moonlight, just how are we meant to fight that thing?!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.910
We'll use all four of our Forte Waves in unison.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.960
Gather, Floral Power!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.000
Blossom Tact!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.960
Marine Tact!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.550
Shiny Tambourine!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.640
Moon Tact!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.820
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:58.640
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:03.470
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:10.270
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.280
What on earth is this thing?

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:38.360
I thought we defeated it!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.850
My name is Dune, the Desert King.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.710
The Desert King?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:52.030
He's the bad guys' boss?!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.080
You insolent little Precure,

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:58.240
no matter how much you may try to stop me,

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.670
know that your effort is futile.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.980
Behold!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.990
Kaoruko told me about this.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.680
I think it was called the Planet Fortress!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.950
That planet...

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:47.360
This planet was stripped of all 
its greenery by a desert seed—

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.210
the "Desert Devil."

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.010
A desert seed?

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.970
The Desert Devil?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.890
I'll send you another. Consider it a present.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.850
It shall reach the Earth quite soon.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.690
Then not only will your planet's greenery perish,

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.040
but so too will the Flowers in all human Hearts perish.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.820
And the Great Heart Tree as well.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.020
We'll never let that happen!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.040
That's right!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:25.330
We'll protect the Great Heart Tree and the Flowers of everyone's Hearts!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:32.190
Well then, I look forward to seeing just whether or not you can fight off the Desert Devil.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.980
Jeez, I don't believe this!

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:53.150
Why did King Dune just send the desert seed to Earth without even turning to us to help?!

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:57.990
It seems he intends to do more than merely turn the Earth into a desert.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:03.120
His true objective is to destroy the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.920
We cannot permit it to unleash its true power, after all.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.880
It won't be long now before
 the desert seed reaches Earth.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.440
What do we do now?

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.140
The answer's obvious!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:20.010
No matter who we have to face, we just have to beat 'em up!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.160
What if we can't?

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:27.470
It's not just our lives at stake in this battle, but those of everyone on Earth.

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.230
We have to be certain we can win.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.020
We've only got one choice.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:38.470
We'll use what little time we have left to build up our strength.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.120
If it's further power that you seek,

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:46.290
then you'll have to return to the Precure Palace.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.280
Once you pass the final trial that awaits you there,

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:53.670
you will be able to obtain even greater powers as Precure.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.670
The final trial?

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:00.470
So this one will be even tougher than when we were granted the Mirage?

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.970
Yes. It'll be a tough battle for you.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.350
But if we can pass the trial...

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.440
...we'll obtain greater powers?

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.310
Then we've gotta do it!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:13.320
Right!

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.920
Where are we?

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.240
Where's everyone?

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:33.770
Marine!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.400
Sunshine!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.040
Moonlight!

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.490
I wonder where they all went.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.410
Why have we all been separated like this?

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:57.610
There has to be some reason we've been isolated from each other.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:11.350
Why couldn't I have shtayed with Sunshine?

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:16.470
The final trial is something that each Precure must face on their own.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:19.770
You aren't allowed to be there with them.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.780
So all we can do is wait here and wish them luck?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:40.540
Huh?!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.600
What?!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:57.450
Isn't this final trial thing gonna start soon?

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.960
Whaaat?!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.470
You're...

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:25.090
The final trial is a fight against ourselves?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.420
I am not merely you.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.010
I am your shadow self.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.720
My shadow self?

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:35.560
Just as the Moon has a dark side, so too 
does your heart have dark shadows within.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.700
And that is I, your shadow self!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.340
Hmph.

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:51.240
I want to be a popular model like Momo too!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.450
I want to be beautiful! I want to be loved!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.840
<i>So this shadow self is how I used to be?</i>

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.710
But you still want that, don't you?!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.730
I wanted to protect my brother!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:27.070
I had to continue training in the martial arts to protect him and the Myoudouin family!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:32.280
I had to cast my plushies and my pretty dresses aside and put everything I had into training!

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.030
<i>That's how I used to think.</i>

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.360
I'm not like that anymore!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:47.340
I practice not for my brother or my family, but because I love doing it!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:50.300
And as for my plushies and my pretty dresses,

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:54.260
I've grown to be able to admit I like those too!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.760
So even though I worked so hard to get you here, you don't need me anymore?!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.890
Huh?!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:07.080
I couldn't protect Cologne!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:12.990
Because I was stupid enough to think I had to fight alone, I ended up losing Cologne!

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.160
<i>That's right.</i>

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>Cologne perished because I thought I
 couldn't share my burden with anyone.</i>

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:26.510
And then...

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:31.760
In my sadness, I ended up forgetting 
the things that were most dear to me!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:38.170
But thanks to the strong hearts of Blossom and the others, who would always smile for me,

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.890
I've become stronger!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.110
So that I can protect everyone's hearts!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.200
The cycle of sorrow...

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:04.290
The cycle of sorrow can only be broken if you're prepared to accept it and move forward.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:13.760
You know, it's thanks to Tsubomi and the others 
that I realized I've got good traits of my own too.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:18.200
So I'm not jealous of Momo for being a model anymore.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:21.180
I just want to become someone as amazing as she is!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.640
Then why do I still exist?!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.520
Why wouldn't you?

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.610
All those negative thoughts are a part of me too!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:39.650
I don't hate you, though,

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:43.200
because I love every last thing about myself!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:10.310
That's right.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:13.900
My brother would always accept it all, just as he welcomed the Sun's rays.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.290
Why did you drop your guard?!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.630
Because you're not my enemy.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:37.530
No matter what wonderful or sad things happened,

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:41.050
my brother would always accept that and smile down at me.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:45.060
I want to be able to accept everything too.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.430
Everything?!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:56.630
The old, hardened me and the me who's grown to be honest with herself are both precious parts of who I am.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.090
So I'll accept every facet of myself.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.770
That way I can smile with the 
same kindness my brother does.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:21.180
I don't intend to fight alone any longer.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:26.480
We'll get through these problems together.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.760
You think you can?

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.680
With your heart still torn in two like this?

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.930
Oh, I'm not saying it's going to be easy.

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:36.640
But I made a promise to myself.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:41.450
That I'd keep fighting so every heart could one day find happiness.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:50.250
Then it seems you have no need for me any longer—

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:55.510
the sadness within you that
 will only tear at your resolve.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:58.940
That's not true.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:02.200
I've chosen to live with this sadness.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:06.660
And one day, that sadness shall be enveloped in love.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:24.610
Marine!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:27.960
Huh? I'm back!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.300
Does that mean I passed the final trial?

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.600
Marine!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.410
Coffret!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.260
That's great!

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:35.580
Look at that shtatue!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.960
It's become Cure Marine!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:44.890
When you pass the final trial, the Precure
 Palace is adorned with a statue in your honor.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.850
Oh, sho that's why!

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.950
You look so cool!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.520
Sunshine!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.640
Potpourri!

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:58.320
I'm sho glad you're shafe!

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:04.330
Moonlight!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.490
So you two passed the final trial as well?

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:23.210
Where's Blossom?

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.090
It appears she's not back yet.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.520
I wonder what happened to Blossom.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.570
Cure Blossom.

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:53.930
You won't be able to change.

00:21:57.070 --> 00:22:00.530
You are incapable of changing.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:25.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:32.630
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:38.210
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:47.180
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:53.890
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.990
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:04.370
All those

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:08.960
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:14.200
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.870
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:21.090
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:27.220
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:31.310
With all our might!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.600
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.770
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:47.030
<i>I'll surpass my old withdrawn self and 
grow together with my beloved friends!</i>

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:48.820
<i>Change into a new you!</i>

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.320
<i>HeartCatch Mirage, grant us new power!</i>

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:55.410
<i>Our shining new forms reveal the strong light within our hearts!</i>

00:23:55.410 --> 00:24:00.080
<i>Their name is "HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!"</i>

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:02.710
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.760
Precures,

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.760
Precures,

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:08.590
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
